! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! cmavo: da'e (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a remote future utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* that (to be said much later) - ''Ug. I can't think of anything better, but this is ugly. - mi'e.aionys.''

!!! Usage examples
;ko'a ba tavla do zo'e ti'u lo djedi poi jersi ti .i da'e ba barda spaji:"He'll tell you tomorrow. IT will be a doozy."

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: da'u (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a remote past utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* that (said much earlier)

!!! Usage examples
;ko'e pu na kakne djuno lo du'u da'u jetnu:"She couldn't have known that IT would be true."

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: de'e (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a near future utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* that (to be said later)

!!! Usage examples
;mi de'e jundi .u'u:"Sorry, I'll be paying attention soon." - ''rlp said this at 14 Nov 2005 15:26:34 in the IRC logs, I'm guessing the English is a correct translation. - mi'e.aionys.''
;.a'o do na'e pensi lo nu de'e fenki:"I hope you don't think what I'm about to say is crazy." - ''gunspoja, IRC log, 09 Jan 2008 17:41:27 - mi'e.aionys.''

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: de'u (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to a recent utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* dei
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* that (said earlier)

!!! Usage examples
;no da de'u mi sidbo:"None of that was my idea." - ''eimi, IRC Log, 21 Oct 2005 09:11:35 - mi'e.aionys.''

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: dei (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to this utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* di'e
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* this (being said)

!!! Usage examples
;dei jetnu jufra:"What I am saying (at this moment) is true."
;xu le ve cusku be dei cu cnino do:"Are you new to expressing in this medium?" - ''kpreid, IRC Logs, 22 Oct 2005 17:56:43 - mi'e.aionys.''

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: di'e (KOhA2)

!!!Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to the next utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'u
* do'i

!!! Keywords:
that (said next)

!!! Usage Examples
;la saimn. cusku di'e: "Simon says:"

!!! Notes

!! cmavo: di'u (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to the previous utterance.

!!! See also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* do'i

!!! Proposed keywords
* that (just said)

!!! Usage examples
;.i di'u jitfa jufra: "That (which you just said) is untrue."

!!! Notes
Is often used with {la'e}:
;lo termarxa doi .imos. .i xu do djica la'e di'u .i lo termarxa: "Pulp, Emo! Is that what you want, pulp?"
;mi prami la djein. .i mi nelci la'e di'u: "I love Jane, and I like that."

!! cmavo: do'i (KOhA2)

!!! Proposed definition
A pro-sumti referring to an unspecified utterance.

!!! See Also
* da'e
* da'u
* de'e
* de'u
* dei
* di'e
* di'u

!!! Proposed keywords
* something (said)

!!! Usage examples
;do'i jetnu jufra:"That's true (where "that" is not necessarily what was just said)."

!!! Notes

! Notes


! Impact

